<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sapala et al. (2018) & Fu et al. (2005) ROP2-ROP6 interdigitated puzzle-shaped pavement cell lobing and Largest Empty Circle (LEC) turgor stress scaling — Code-to-model traceability: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every governing equation to Sapala et al. (2018) eLife Figs. 1-5 & Box 1, Fu et al. (2005) Cell Figs. 1-7, Lin et al. (2013) Curr. Biol., Bidhendi et al. (2019) Nat. Plants, and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_039_pavement_cell_lobing.lean` (L1-51)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
